YSE:CCI) Investors?","src":"Kalkine Media","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxORzY1NTIxZ1Q5ci0tTndGX0cteGJKUU5DQ29oMGJPdy1sellHTDlhR0VQVENWWjZGSk13eXdnTjdNZUJXUmJOaHZiRWdXVHI3WHY5Tm1PbVNKQ0FYUkc1U1BBRExYemxFcmdRbHVlVjFjaG9GNkN6Y0tudGRWOVppcDQxeGFfeUVjU2M4dEQySFhaelVCRTJnZU5IZGY5RzJCanlOYm5UbmFVRDRWT2hDZDZ4amkxMWZsZWZ5bWFSWlRDMkNrNXJzem13?oc=5","date":"2026-11-20","zh":""},{"title":"DISH reaches $525 million deal with American Tower as Crown Castle says it got no calls in eight weeks","src":"Wireless Estimator","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"DISH 與 American Tower 達成 5.25 億美元的交易，Crown Castle 表示八週內沒有接到任何電話"},{"title":"Dish settles with American Tower, but Crown Castle left out so far","src":"Light Reading","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNQ2xyTVJ3cldneXZtd2hXQmZMMWhRbHlnUnhiNEtROXN0N1JQdnM5QklFZmQ5N1VRX1lySVJrbzN5bXF2djFuaGxSc1NWbUQ3ZzJ2enJ0T1ZQLUZvQXpLbXRORmlXeC1jbnRvVkxiV1JXakN1azdybFZEYlotWlpCSjZGN1gyYkc1bzNtSk5ycWpwMFJPT1JpbXFVcmQ0ZjFSUTY0bQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"菜色已與美國塔達成和解，但皇冠城堡目前尚未解決"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-23","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1051470/000105147026000016/cci-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We own, operate and lease shared communications infrastructure that is geographically dispersed throughout the U.S., including (1) more than 40,000 towers and other structures, such as rooftops (collectively, \"towers\"), (2) approximately 105,000 small cell nodes either currently generating revenue or under contract and (3) approximately 90,000 route miles of fiber primarily supporting small cells and fiber solutions. We refer to our towers, small cells and fiber assets collectively as \"communications infrastructure,\" and, at times, to our customers on our communications infrastructure as \"tenants.\" Our operating segments historically consisted of (1) Towers and (2) Fiber, which includes both small cells and fiber solutions.","zh":"我们拥有、运营和租赁分布在美国各地的共享通信基础设施，包括 (1) 超过 40,000 座塔楼和其他结构，例如屋顶（统称为“塔楼”），(2) 约 105,000 个当前正在产生收入或已签订合同的小型蜂窝节点，以及 (3) 约 90,000 路由英里的光纤，主要支持小型蜂窝和光纤解决方案。我们将我们的塔、小型基站和光纤资产统称为“通信基础设施”，有时将我们通信基础设施上的客户称为“租户”。我們的營運部門歷來由 (1) 塔式和 (2) 光纖組成，其中包括小型基地台和光纖解決方案。"},{"en":"On March 13, 2025, management signed a definitive agreement (\"Strategic Fiber Agreement\") to sell our Fiber segment, together with certain supporting assets and personnel (\"Fiber Business\"), with Zayo Group Holdings Inc. (\"Zayo\") acquiring the fiber solutions business and EQT Active Core Infrastructure fund (\"EQT\") acquiring the small cell business (\"Strategic Fiber Transaction\"). Under the agreement, we will receive $8.5 billion in aggregate, subject to certain closing adjustments. The Strategic Fiber Transaction is expected to close in the first half of 2026, subject to certain closing conditions and regulatory approvals.","zh":"2025 年 3 月 13 日，管理层签署了一份最终协议（“战略光纤协议”），出售我们的光纤部门以及某些支持性资产和人员（“光纤业务”），Zayo Group Holdings Inc.（“Zayo”）收购光纤解决方案业务，EQT Active Core Infrastructure 基金（“EQT”）收购小型基站业务（“战略光纤交易”）。根據協議，我們將總共獲得 85 億美元，但需進行某些成交調整。戰略纖維交易預計將於 2026 年上半年完成，但須滿足某些成交條件和監管部門的批准。"},{"en":"As the aforementioned sale represents a material strategic shift for the Company, the Fiber Business' results and net assets are presented herein as discontinued operations and comparable prior periods have been recast to reflect this change. Pending the closing of the Strategic Fiber Transaction, we will continue to operate the Fiber Business in accordance with the Strategic Fiber Agreement. Following the classification of the Fiber Business as discontinued operations, the Company has one reportable segment, which is also its operating segment, that constitutes consolidated results consisting of its towers operations. Unless otherwise noted, all activities and amounts reported in this document relate to the continuing operations of the Company and exclude activities and amounts related to the Fiber Business.","zh":"由于上述出售代表了公司的重大战略转变，纤维业务的业绩和净资产在本文中作为已终止经营业务和可比前期进行了重新调整，以反映这一变化。在戰略纖維交易完成之前，我們將繼續根據戰略纖維協議經營纖維業務。将纤维业务分类为已终止经营业务后，该公司有一个可报告分部，也是其经营分部，构成由塔业务组成的综合业绩。除非另有说明，本文件中报告的所有活动和金额均与公司的持续经营有关，不包括与纤维业务相关的活动和金额。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{},"peers":["AMT","SBAC","DLR","PLD","EQIX"]}}